==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|theoretick}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|theōrēticus}}, from {{der|en|grc|θεωρητικός}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌθiːəˈɹɛtɪk/|/ˌθɪə̯ˈɹɛtɪk/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Concerned with [[theories]] or [[hypotheses]] rather than with [[practical]] matters.
# Existing only in [[theory]], not proven in [[reality]].

